{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231330","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231330","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1423133001:0":{"text":"여기가 셀로클랜드입니다... 시간이 부족하니 가볍게 둘러보는 것으로 하지요.","source_cn":"这里便是萨洛克兰王城，有广场，市集，演武场，宫殿……时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC85ADCC3112DB5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1423133002:0":{"text":"이렇게 큰 왕성이라니! 이걸 지으려고 드워프들이 얼마나 고생을 했을지...","source_cn":"规模这么大的王城！为了修这些，矮人得出多少力啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA0C59F00EE603EC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"인듀어","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:铁须":{"text":"아이언비어드","source":"铁须","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}}